@startuml sequence_scheduler
title Sequence Diagram — Scheduler nhắc giờ học (tự động)

skinparam SequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor DarkGreen

participant "APScheduler"       as SC
participant "Java API\n(:8081)" as API
database    "MySQL"             as DB
participant "Python Bot"        as Bot
participant "Telegram API"      as TG
actor       "Người dùng"        as User

== Mỗi phút: Kiểm tra lịch học sắp tới ==

SC   -> API : GET /schedule/upcoming\n?minutesAhead=30
API  -> DB  : SELECT u.telegram_id, s.name,\n  cs.start_time, cs.room\nFROM class_sessions cs\nJOIN subjects s ON cs.subject_id=s.id\nJOIN users u ON s.user_id=u.id\nJOIN user_settings us ON u.id=us.user_id\nWHERE cs.day_of_week = DAYOFWEEK(NOW())\nAND TIME(cs.start_time) BETWEEN\n  TIME(NOW()) AND ADDTIME(TIME(NOW()), '00:30:00')\nAND us.notify_class_remind = true

DB  --> API : [{ telegramId:123, subject:"Java",\n   startTime:"07:00", room:"B1-301" }]
API --> SC  : [ReminderDTO, ...]

loop Mỗi reminder (delay 50ms để tránh flood)
    SC   -> Bot  : send_class_reminder(\n  telegram_id=123,\n  subject="Java Programming",\n  time="07:00")
    Bot  -> TG   : sendMessage(123,\n  "⏰ Nhắc lịch học\n🏫 Java Programming lúc 07:00\n📍 Phòng B1-301")
    TG   -> User : Thông báo push Telegram
end

@enduml
